### CampusQuest Question Bank Tests

### 1. Get Questions with Filters
GET http://localhost:5000/questions?subjectId=1&difficulty=MEDIUM&unit=3

### 2. Get Question by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/questions/1

### 3. Create Question (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:5000/questions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject_id": 1,
    "unit": 3,
    "topic": "Functional Dependencies",
    "question_text": "If X -> Y and Y -> Z hold, which Armstrong axiom concludes X -> Z?",
    "difficulty": "EASY",
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "explanation": "The Transitivity rule states that if X -> Y and Y -> Z, then X -> Z.",
    "options": [
        { "key": "A", "text": "Reflexivity" },
        { "key": "B", "text": "Transitivity" },
        { "key": "C", "text": "Augmentation" },
        { "key": "D", "text": "Decomposition" }
    ]
}
